---
import SectionHeader from '@andrew/ui/SectionHeader.astro';
---

<section class="section problem-section" id="creator-problem">
  <div class="container">
    <SectionHeader
      index="01"
      kicker="THE CREATOR DILEMMA"
      title="The Problem With Modern Content Creation"
      lede="Web-based social media management tools were built for corporate enterprise marketers—not high-output video creators. Here is why the cloud model breaks down:"
      id="creator-problem"
    />

    <div class="comparison-grid">
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="comparison-card">
        <div class="card-icon">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
            <line x1="3" y1="9" x2="21" y2="9"></line>
            <line x1="9" y1="21" x2="9" y2="9"></line>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="problem-title">Fragmented Spreadsheets & Lost Raw Video</h3>
        <p class="problem-desc">
          Creators juggle Google Sheets, Notion boards, Dropbox links, and local hard drives. Finding the exact raw video where you said a specific quote takes hours of manual scrubbing.
        </p>
        <div class="solution-box">
          <div class="solution-badge">Reelay Solution</div>
          <p class="solution-text">
            <strong>Offline Whisper AI & In-App Player:</strong> Instant full-text search across every spoken word in your video catalog. Hardware-accelerated scrubbing with automatic VP9/AV1 proxies.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="comparison-card">
        <div class="card-icon">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="23"></line>
            <path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="problem-title">Cloud Lock-in & 5x AI Token Markups</h3>
        <p class="problem-desc">
          Cloud SaaS tools charge monthly recurring subscription fees just to hold your video library, plus exorbitant markups on third-party LLM writing tokens.
        </p>
        <div class="solution-box">
          <div class="solution-badge">Reelay Solution</div>
          <p class="solution-text">
            <strong>Bring-Your-Own-Assistant (MCP):</strong> Reelay exposes standard Model Context Protocol endpoints. Use Claude, ChatGPT, or Gemini directly. We never bill for or mark up AI tokens.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div class="comparison-card">
        <div class="card-icon">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
            <path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="problem-title">Centralized Server Breaches & Outages</h3>
        <p class="problem-desc">
          Uploading sensitive YouTube and Meta API tokens to multi-tenant cloud databases creates severe compliance and privacy vulnerabilities. When their server drops, your publishing stops.
        </p>
        <div class="solution-box">
          <div class="solution-badge">Reelay Solution</div>
          <p class="solution-text">
            <strong>Apple Keychain & SQLite Architecture:</strong> All tokens stay encrypted in your local OS Keychain. All drafts live in local SQLite. Requests publish directly from your personal machine.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .problem-section {
    background-color: transparent;
  }

  .comparison-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.75rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .comparison-card {
    background-color: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 2rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .comparison-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    border-color: var(--hairline-strong);
  }

  .card-icon {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    background-color: var(--color-surface-2);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    border: 1px solid var(--hairline);
  }

  .problem-title {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .problem-desc {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .solution-box {
    background-color: var(--color-surface-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1.15rem;
  }

  .solution-badge {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--brand);
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  .solution-text {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .solution-text strong {
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .comparison-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
